# Fourmidable: a fortress in the middle, entered through four gates, with
# bastions at its corners.

NAME Fourmidable
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS K M
START 8 8 SE

# The fortress's top wall, from a corner bastion to the gate.
MOVE 9 11
DRAW 9 9
DRAW 13 9

# A redoubt outside the walls.
MOVE 4 15
DRAW 6 15
